    <h1>About</h1>
    <!-- EDIT ME: this is starter copy. -->
    <p>I'm Stephen Abrams. I have a background in mathematics and computer science, and I work in analytics and machine learning in Louisville, KY.</p>
    <p>This site is where I write about probability puzzles, games, and the projects I'm building.</p>
    <h2>Why "Convergent Blue"?</h2>
    <p>From 2006 to 2013 I wrote at <em>divergentblue.com</em>. The domain lapsed, and someone else now runs it. <strong>It is not affiliated with me. Please don't enter any information there.</strong> The posts worth keeping were restored from an old backup and live here now.</p>
    <p>The name is a nod to a series that finally settled down.</p>
